{
  "_": [
    "foo_fighters_pro on jpsalas's 'JPs Foo Fighters' 0.5.0 (VPForums 19519): the",
    "same table as foo_fighters_le.shadow.json, on a Pro card. The table has no",
    "upper playfield and no Overlord magnet or hit coil, as the Pro, so the Pro is",
    "what Patch picks for it when both cards are there (`preferred`). Made from",
    "the LE map: every switch renumbered by its name through the Pro 1.04.0",
    "program's own switch table (each sits on the same node and bit as the LE's),",
    "the LE's coils the Pro has none of left out (the table's outlane post stays",
    "down), the lights as they are (the Pro's LEDs are where the LE's are)."
  ],
